ForgeAnalysisWorkerIpcV1
========================

Status: frozen host-internal companion transport
Version: 1
Byte order: little-endian
Request bytes: 256
Response bytes: 384

This companion is carried only by a local protected worker named pipe whose
server verifies the client's Windows TokenUser SID before parsing the body. It
registers one observer-only ForgeAnalysisRingV1 mapping. It does not grant a
WorkerTokenLeaseV1, stimulation authority, device access, or a raw WebView
channel. Controller-input registration requires a future separately qualified
SafetyArbiter coupling and is rejected by version 1.

AnalysisWorkerRegisterRequestV1
-------------------------------

offset  size  field
0       4     total_len = 256
4       8     magic = ASCII FGANRQ01
12      2     version = 1
14      2     header_len = 256
16      2     operation = 1 (REGISTER_OBSERVER)
18      2     branch_role = 1 (OBSERVER)
20      8     request_id, nonzero and idempotent within producer_epoch
28      8     producer_epoch, nonzero and fresh for a new mapping
36      16    run_id, nonzero
52      16    consumer_id, nonzero and unique within the Run
68      32    worker_build_hash, nonzero
100     4     slot_count, range 2..65536
104     4     slot_payload_capacity_bytes, range 176..1048752
108     32    forge_protocol_hash
140     32    forge_analysis_ring_schema_hash
172     80    reserved_zero
252     4     CRC32C over bytes [0,252)

